note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note C1 control (contract 13-18): an OM-1 unit keeps the OM-2 words as ordinary names: at seal open
note abstract holds layout field little big part export out rotr as scalars, fresh as a parameter,
note dup32mk as a function. Expected stdout oracle/s5s7/exp/t-names.out (python3): 91, dup of 7.
fn dup32mk fresh ulong to ulong
ret or shl fresh 32 fresh
end
fn n1 to ulong
at = ulong 1
seal = ulong 2
open = ulong 3
abstract = ulong 4
holds = ulong 5
layout = ulong 6
field = ulong 7
ret add add add add add add at seal open abstract holds layout field
end
fn n2 to ulong
little = ulong 8
big = ulong 9
part = ulong 10
export = ulong 11
out = ulong 12
rotr = ulong 13
ret add add add add add little big part export out rotr
end
fn main to int
putd add n1 n2
puth dup32mk 7
ret 0
end
